{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object, move to destination, check object properties, do specific task, then drop object or move to destination. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    />",
